        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "The Himmapan Hex",
        "Location": "LOCATION_BANGKOK_ZIKA",
        "PublicId": "116481492341",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/Bangkok/scene_zika.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 99c41e24-2522-492d-802d-6580cd7581dc).Image",
        "Description": "Welcome to Bangkok, 47.\r\rOur client has marked several targets staying in the Himmapan Hotel. \r\rFrank Horrigan, who is dormant in the upper floors, backstabbed our client by sharing classified documents with the public. Juntasa worked alongside Horrigan, letting him bypass through impenetrable layers of security. \rLastly, Vargas and Vaughn, a couple who previously worked with our client, plan to broker a deal with undercover waitress Anant, destroying our client&apos;s reputation.\r\rGood luck, agent.",
